/P 141 0 R
/T (The fund targets approximately 2.0x net MOIC, with an 8 to 10 year exit horizon reflecting the longer development cycles of decarbonization deeptech. With a 1% annual management fee, 15% carried interest with an impact-linked component, and a European-style waterfall, TechAir aligns financial performance with measurable decarbonization impact. Overall, the fund offers LPs the opportunity to support climate innovation while pursuing long-term financial and environmental value.)
/E (The fund targets approximately 2.0x net MOIC, with an 8 to 10 year exit horizon reflecting the longer development cycles of decarbonization deeptech. With a 1% annual management fee, 15% carried interest with an impact-linked component, and a European-style waterfall, TechAir aligns financial performance with measurable decarbonization impact. Overall, the fund offers LPs the opportunity to support climate innovation while pursuing long-term financial and environmental value.)
/Pg 12 0 R
