/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 143 0 R
/T (Ecole Polytechnique Federale de Lausanne is the backbone of the upcoming generation of innovative climate enthusiasts. By providing access to a variety of labs and worldclass education, EPFL has fostered an environment ripe for entrepreunership. In fact, its Innogrant program dedicated to deep tech has awarded more than 200 grants, contributed to the creation of 150 startups, and supported projects that have raised more than CHF 1.8 billion in the last twenty years.)
