1398 0 obj
<<
/Title (TechAir Venture is a student-run impact investment fund focused on early-stage decarbonization deeptech startups. The fund aims to finance technologies that reduce, avoid, or capture greenhouse gas emissions by providing solutions in energy efficiency, carbon capture, and alternative fuels. These solutions are targeted at high-emission sectors such as energy, materials, buildings, transport, and industrial processes, where decarbonization needs are the most urgent.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1102 0 R
/Next 1535 0 R
>>
endobj
1399 0 obj
<<
/Title (The fund targets approximately 2.0x net MOIC, with an 8 to 10 year exit horizon reflecting the longer development cycles of decarbonization deeptech. With a 1% annual management fee, 15% carried interest with an impact-linked component, and a European-style waterfall, TechAir aligns financial performance with measurable decarbonization impact. Overall, the fund offers LPs the opportunity to support climate innovation while pursuing long-term financial and environmental value.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1102 0 R
/Prev 1536 0 R
>>
endobj
