/Title (The fund targets a total size of CHF 500,000, with CHF 200,000 already raised from the GP team and close LP network. The remaining CHF 300,000 is expected from 7 to 10 investment committee investors, each contributing approximately CHF 30,000 to CHF 50,000. TechAir plans to invest in four to five validated early-stage startups, with ticket sizes of CHF 75,000 to CHF 100,000, primarily through post-money SAFEs. This concentrated portfolio allows the fund to provide meaningful financial and strategic support to each company while keeping the investment structure simple and founder-friendly.)
