/Title (Decarbonization therefore requires deeptech solutions: technologies grounded in advanced science, able to overcome technological barriers and transform high-emission sectors. Deeptech startups are particularly relevant because they connect research to the market, develop high-barrier innovations, and can help industrialize the technologies still needed for carbon neutrality. By backing climate deeptech startups, TechAir Ventures aims to turn scientific innovation into measurable solutions that reduce, avoid, or capture emissions where the transition is most urgent.)
