/Title (We propose a 15% carry, below the standard 20%, to reflect our student-led structure while preserving performance incentives,  calculated on committed capital to ensure LPs first recover their full commitment. Of this carry, 5% would be impact-linked and paid only if portfolio-level decarbonization targets are met. To preserve upside incentives, carry could increase to 18% only if the fund significantly exceeds both financial and impact targets.)
/Dest [24 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1766 0 R
