<<
/Title (We prioritize companies where commercial growth and climate impact reinforce each other: as the company scales, its decarbonization impact increases.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1824 0 R
>>
endobj
1830 0 obj
<<
/Title (Our objective is to combine disciplined long-term financial returns with measurable climate impact. Each investment must be assessed through both a financial and impact lens.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1827 0 R
>>
